    },
    {
      "number": 44,
      "category": "",
      "title": "晉書卷四十四·華嶠傳",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-044-huaqiao:line106",
      "count": 13,
      "raw_count": 13,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "嶠字叔駿，才學深博，少有令聞。文帝為大將軍，辟為掾屬，補尚書郎，轉車騎從事中郎。泰始初，賜爵關內侯。遷太子中庶子。出為安平太守。辭親老不行，更拜散騎常侍，典中書著作，領國子博士，遷侍中。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-jinshu-044-huaqiao:line106",
        "c-jinshu-044-huaqiao:line108",
        "c-jinshu-044-huaqiao:line110",
        "c-jinshu-044-huaqiao:line112",
        "c-jinshu-044-huaqiao:line114"
      ],
